---
import MemoryDiagramMobile from './MemoryDiagramMobile.astro';
---
<section class="memory" id="how">
  <div class="container memory__grid">
    <div class="memory__copy">
      <h2>The Memory Layer:<br>one memory, every system</h2>
      <p class="lead">Deepvine connects your firm's information, keeps it updated, and makes it available to any model or tool you choose.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="memory__art">
      <img class="memory__diagram" src="/assets/img/memory-layer.webp" width="1774" height="887" loading="lazy" alt="Documents, conversations, deal data, and internal systems flow into the Deepvine device, which serves any AI model, Deepvine.AI agents, Slack, and your tools.">

      <MemoryDiagramMobile />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
